<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<WorkflowBuilder Version="2.9.0"
                 xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance"
                 xmlns:rx="clr-namespace:Bonsai.Reactive;assembly=Bonsai.Core"
                 xmlns:sys="clr-namespace:System;assembly=mscorlib"
                 xmlns:scr="clr-namespace:Bonsai.Scripting.Expressions;assembly=Bonsai.Scripting.Expressions"
                 xmlns:harp="clr-namespace:Bonsai.Harp;assembly=Bonsai.Harp"
                 xmlns:core="clr-namespace:OpenRigs.Core;assembly=OpenRigs.Core"
                 xmlns:dev="clr-namespace:OpenRigs.Devices;assembly=OpenRigs.Devices"
                 xmlns:zap="clr-namespace:OpenRigs.Devices.Zapit;assembly=OpenRigs.Devices"
                 xmlns:orcl="clr-namespace:OpenRigs.Control;assembly=OpenRigs.Control"
                 xmlns:orl="clr-namespace:OpenRigs.Logging;assembly=OpenRigs.Logging"
                 xmlns:hd="clr-namespace:OpenRigs.HarpDevices;assembly=OpenRigs.HarpDevices"
                 xmlns:mf="clr-namespace:OpenRigs.Manifest;assembly=OpenRigs.Manifest"
                 xmlns:lv="clr-namespace:OpenRigs.LiveView;assembly=OpenRigs.LiveView"
                 xmlns:gl="clr-namespace:Bonsai.Shaders;assembly=Bonsai.Shaders"
                 xmlns:al="clr-namespace:Bonsai.Audio;assembly=Bonsai.Audio"
                 xmlns:aud="clr-namespace:OpenRigs.Audio;assembly=OpenRigs.Audio"
                 xmlns:p1="clr-namespace:;assembly=Extensions"
                 xmlns:rig="clr-namespace:OpenRigs.Devices.Rigs;assembly=OpenRigs.Devices"
                 xmlns:p6="clr-namespace:UclOpenCoenDomeDecisionMakingTask;assembly=Extensions"
                 xmlns="https://bonsai-rx.org/2018/workflow">
  <Workflow>
    <Nodes>
      <Expression xsi:type="IncludeWorkflow" Path="OpenRigs.Devices:ReadLabRig.bonsai">
        <Description>This machine's rig.yml (ConfigRoot\MACHINE\rig.yml) read once into the lab rig model: RigConfigs, RigFile, RigConfigDirectory and ConfigRoot, which every device piece reads. First, before anything that reads them.</Description>
        <ConfigRoot>C:\Coen-Lab-Local\RigConfigs</ConfigRoot>
      </Expression>
      <Expression xsi:type="ExternalizedMapping">
        <Property Name="SubjectId" />
        <Property Name="SessionId" />
        <Property Name="TaskPath" />
      </Expression>
      <Expression xsi:type="GroupWorkflow">
        <Name>Initialization</Name>
        <Description>The experiment controller (OpenRigs.Control, ExperimentControl) over TCP 5561: SubjectId (the mouse's lab ID, or test) and SessionId are the launch's; the parameter a controller may change until Go (TrainingStage; the task's own settings are the task file's, which rig-control writes at launch and again at Go with the form's edits, and names in TaskPath); the pieces declare their own parameters and commands (16 Nov 2026). The workflow starts into ready mode (devices connected, spouts homed and at this mouse's positions, live view on, nothing recorded) and reports Ready from Hardware. LaunchSettings (OpenRigs.Control) publishes SubjectId and TaskFilePath (TaskPath) at Start and RunSettings (SubjectId, SessionId) at Go; TrainingStage (OpenRigs.Control) publishes TrainingStage at Go and reports it as the metric trainingStage. SpoutStepSize and the spout commands are DomeHardware's LickSpoutStage's, which takes the step size live and shows its default. RewardLeft and RewardRight each give 2.5 ul before and during a run through the valve's calibration (BehaviorBoard.ManualRewards: Pip's fixed manual drop, 15 Nov 2026).</Description>
        <Workflow>
          <Nodes>
            <Expression xsi:type="ExternalizedMapping">
              <Property Name="SessionId" />
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="ExternalizedMapping">
              <Property Name="SubjectId" />
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="IncludeWorkflow" Path="OpenRigs.Control:ExperimentControl.bonsai">
              <SubjectId />
              <SessionId />
              <ControlEndpoint>@tcp://127.0.0.1:5561</ControlEndpoint>
              <Parameters>
                <Parameter>
                  <Name>TrainingStage</Name>
                  <Value>4</Value>
                  <Description>Row of the task file's trainingStages to run: the GUI's Training Stage. A row past the end of the task file's table stops the workflow at Go.</Description>
                  <Minimum>0</Minimum>
                  <Maximum>4</Maximum>
                  <WholeNumber>true</WholeNumber>
                </Parameter>
              </Parameters>
              <Commands />
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="ExternalizedMapping">
              <Property Name="TaskPath" Description="The task file: rig-control's copy of the one chosen at launch, read at Start for the background noise and again at Go with the form's edits; from the editor, config\task-localization.yml." />
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="IncludeWorkflow" Path="OpenRigs.Control:LaunchSettings.bonsai">
              <SubjectId />
              <TaskPath>..\config\task-localization.yml</TaskPath>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="IncludeWorkflow" Path="OpenRigs.Control:TrainingStage.bonsai" />
          </Nodes>
          <Edges>
            <Edge From="0" To="2" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="1" To="2" Label="Source2" />
            <Edge From="1" To="4" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="3" To="4" Label="Source2" />
          </Edges>
        </Workflow>
      </Expression>
      <Expression xsi:type="GroupWorkflow">
        <Name>TaskFile</Name>
        <Description>Reads the task file (TaskPath) at Start into LaunchTaskConfig, as rig-control wrote it at launch, for the background noise, which plays from Ready; and at Go, with the form's edits, into TaskConfig. BackgroundNoise stops the workflow at Go if backgroundNoise was changed after launch, as the noise already plays at the launch's level.</Description>
        <Workflow>
          <Nodes>
            <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
              <Name>ExperimentGo</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
              <Combinator xsi:type="rx:Take">
                <rx:Count>1</rx:Count>
              </Combinator>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
              <Name>TaskFilePath</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
              <Combinator xsi:type="rx:Zip" />
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="MemberSelector">
              <Selector>Item2</Selector>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
              <Combinator xsi:type="core:ReadTextFile" />
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="p6:DeserializeFromYaml">
              <p6:Type xsi:type="TypeMapping" TypeArguments="p6:UclOpenCoenDomeDecisionMakingTaskLogic" />
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="rx:AsyncSubject">
              <Name>TaskConfig</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
              <Name>TaskFilePath</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
              <Combinator xsi:type="core:ReadTextFile" />
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="p6:DeserializeFromYaml">
              <p6:Type xsi:type="TypeMapping" TypeArguments="p6:UclOpenCoenDomeDecisionMakingTaskLogic" />
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="rx:AsyncSubject">
              <Name>LaunchTaskConfig</Name>
            </Expression>
          </Nodes>
          <Edges>
            <Edge From="0" To="1" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="1" To="3" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="2" To="3" Label="Source2" />
            <Edge From="3" To="4" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="4" To="5" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="5" To="6" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="6" To="7" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="8" To="9" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="9" To="10" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="10" To="11" Label="Source1" />
          </Edges>
        </Workflow>
      </Expression>
      <Expression xsi:type="GroupWorkflow">
        <Name>Declarations</Name>
        <Description>Subjects the groups share. Trial (each trial as drawn) and TrialRow (each trial's BonsaiData_Trial row, built when the outcome is known); TrialEnds closes the trial loop; DecisionVariable and the grating's azimuth carry the response; VisualStimulus, VisualStimulusOff, AuditoryStimulus and PenaltySound start the stimuli; Zapit's commands and replies; RewardRequests, each (side, microlitres) reward, the side as rig.yml's wiring names it (left, right). Every subject a per-trial graph multicasts into is a BehaviorSubject: Bonsai passes a multicast's completion to a PublishSubject, so the first trial's graph closed it and the grating, the sound and the spouts ran on trial 1 only (BLUE-OPTO-2, 14 Nov 2026). VisualStimulusOff (subscribed per grating) and the blocks' LickSpoutStage.Commands and BehaviorBoard-Main.Commands are fed through VisualStimulusOffFeed, LickSpoutStageFeed and BehaviorBoardFeed, each relayed once at TaskLogic's top level.</Description>
        <Workflow>
          <Nodes>
            <Expression xsi:type="rx:BehaviorSubject" TypeArguments="p1:Trial">
              <rx:Name>Trial</rx:Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="rx:PublishSubject" TypeArguments="p1:TrialEnd">
              <rx:Name>TrialEnds</rx:Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="rx:BehaviorSubject" TypeArguments="harp:Timestamped(p1:TrialRow)">
              <rx:Name>TrialRow</rx:Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="rx:BehaviorSubject" TypeArguments="sys:Int32">
              <rx:Name>DecisionVariable</rx:Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="rx:BehaviorSubject" TypeArguments="sys:Double">
              <rx:Name>GratingAzimuthStart</rx:Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="rx:BehaviorSubject" TypeArguments="sys:Double">
              <rx:Name>GratingAzimuthDeg</rx:Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="rx:BehaviorSubject" TypeArguments="p1:Trial">
              <rx:Name>VisualStimulus</rx:Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="rx:PublishSubject" TypeArguments="harp:Timestamped(sys:Double)">
              <rx:Name>VisualStimulusOff</rx:Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="rx:BehaviorSubject" TypeArguments="p1:Trial">
              <rx:Name>AuditoryStimulus</rx:Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="rx:BehaviorSubject" TypeArguments="sys:String">
              <rx:Name>PenaltySound</rx:Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="rx:PublishSubject" TypeArguments="zap:ZapitReply">
              <rx:Name>ZapitReplies</rx:Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="rx:BehaviorSubject" TypeArguments="sys:Tuple(sys:String,sys:Double)">
              <rx:Name>RewardRequests</rx:Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="rx:BehaviorSubject" TypeArguments="harp:Timestamped(sys:Double)">
              <rx:Name>VisualStimulusOffFeed</rx:Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="rx:BehaviorSubject" TypeArguments="dev:LickSpoutCommand">
              <rx:Name>LickSpoutStageFeed</rx:Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="rx:BehaviorSubject" TypeArguments="harp:HarpMessage">
              <rx:Name>BehaviorBoardFeed</rx:Name>
            </Expression>
          </Nodes>
          <Edges>
          </Edges>
        </Workflow>
      </Expression>
      <Expression xsi:type="IncludeWorkflow" Path="OpenRigs.Logging:LogLabExperiment.bonsai">
        <Description>The experiment folder at Go (PathPrefix), BonsaiData_Async, Settings_Rig, Settings_Experiment and the Recording phase. Before Hardware: every device's log waits for PathPrefix, so its definition must read nothing the devices define.</Description>
      </Expression>
      <Expression xsi:type="ExternalizedMapping">
        <Property Name="DisplayDevice" Description="The display the dome projector is on; a launch property." />
      </Expression>
      <Expression xsi:type="GroupWorkflow">
        <Name>Hardware</Name>
        <Description>The dome's devices (OpenRigs.Devices DomeHardware: every device as a piece, each logging itself; the cameras triggered once all three acquire; the speakers and their mixer; the projector, DisplayDevice a launch property), with Ready once the Harp clock is set, the spouts are homed, each camera has sent a frame and the mixer has started, and a stop naming what never came after 180 s.</Description>
        <Workflow>
          <Nodes>
            <Expression xsi:type="IncludeWorkflow" Path="OpenRigs.Devices:DomeHardware.bonsai">
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="ExternalizedMapping">
              <Property Name="DisplayDevice" />
            </Expression>
          </Nodes>
          <Edges>
            <Edge From="1" To="0" Label="Source1" />
          </Edges>
        </Workflow>
      </Expression>
      <Expression xsi:type="GroupWorkflow">
        <Name>Display</Name>
        <Description>Each trial's grating, drawn on DomeHardware's projector (DrawStimuli).</Description>
        <Workflow>
          <Nodes>
            <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
              <Name>VisualStimulus</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="rx:SelectMany">
              <Name>ShowGrating</Name>
              <Description>Draws a trial's grating from VisualStimulus until VisualStimulusOff: contrast, elevation and phase the trial's, the rest the task's, the azimuth GratingAzimuthDeg (closed loop moves it), flickering at the stimulus set's pulse rate, with the photodiode square black on its on frames and white on its off frames.</Description>
              <Workflow>
                <Nodes>
                  <Expression xsi:type="WorkflowInput">
                    <Name>Source1</Name>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
                    <Combinator xsi:type="rx:Take">
                      <rx:Count>1</rx:Count>
                    </Combinator>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="rx:AsyncSubject">
                    <Name>GratingTrial</Name>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
                    <Name>DrawStimuli</Name>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
                    <Name>Flicker</Name>
                    <Description>The grating on and off at the auditory stimulus set's pulse rate (AuditoryStimulusSet.PulseRateHz): each half period is its FlickerHalfPeriod, mapped in. A render-clock stimulus, not a task wait.</Description>
                    <Combinator xsi:type="gl:Timer">
                      <gl:DueTime>PT0S</gl:DueTime>
                      <gl:Period>PT0S</gl:Period>
                    </Combinator>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="Mod">
                    <Operand xsi:type="WorkflowProperty" TypeArguments="sys:Int64">
                      <Value>2</Value>
                    </Operand>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
                    <Combinator xsi:type="rx:WithLatestFrom" />
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="rx:Condition">
                    <Name>On?</Name>
                    <Workflow>
                      <Nodes>
                        <Expression xsi:type="WorkflowInput">
                          <Name>Source1</Name>
                        </Expression>
                        <Expression xsi:type="scr:ExpressionTransform">
                          <scr:Expression>Item2 == 0</scr:Expression>
                        </Expression>
                        <Expression xsi:type="WorkflowOutput" />
                      </Nodes>
                      <Edges>
                        <Edge From="0" To="1" Label="Source1" />
                        <Edge From="1" To="2" Label="Source1" />
                      </Edges>
                    </Workflow>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="MemberSelector">
                    <Selector>Item1</Selector>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="rx:Condition">
                    <Name>Off?</Name>
                    <Workflow>
                      <Nodes>
                        <Expression xsi:type="WorkflowInput">
                          <Name>Source1</Name>
                        </Expression>
                        <Expression xsi:type="scr:ExpressionTransform">
                          <scr:Expression>Item2 != 0</scr:Expression>
                        </Expression>
                        <Expression xsi:type="WorkflowOutput" />
                      </Nodes>
                      <Edges>
                        <Edge From="0" To="1" Label="Source1" />
                        <Edge From="1" To="2" Label="Source1" />
                      </Edges>
                    </Workflow>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="MemberSelector">
                    <Selector>Item1</Selector>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="PropertyMapping">
                    <PropertyMappings>
                      <Property Name="Contrast" Selector="visualContrast" />
                      <Property Name="LocationY" Selector="visualElevationDeg" />
                      <Property Name="Phase" Selector="visualPhaseRad" />
                    </PropertyMappings>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
                    <Name>GratingTrial</Name>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="PropertyMapping">
                    <PropertyMappings>
                      <Property Name="TemporalFrequency" Selector="TaskParameters.VisualStimulus.TemporalFrequencyHz" />
                      <Property Name="SpatialFrequency" Selector="TaskParameters.VisualStimulus.SpatialFrequencyCpd" />
                      <Property Name="Angle" Selector="TaskParameters.VisualStimulus.OrientationDeg" />
                    </PropertyMappings>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
                    <Name>TaskConfig</Name>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="PropertyMapping">
                    <PropertyMappings>
                      <Property Name="Aperture" Selector="it" />
                    </PropertyMappings>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
                    <Name>TaskConfig</Name>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="scr:ExpressionTransform">
                    <scr:Name>Aperture</scr:Name>
                    <scr:Description>The Gaussian window's sigma relative to the grating's 100 degree extent.</scr:Description>
                    <scr:Expression>TaskParameters.VisualStimulus.GaussianWindowSigmaDeg * 2 / 100.0</scr:Expression>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="PropertyMapping">
                    <PropertyMappings>
                      <Property Name="LocationX" />
                    </PropertyMappings>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
                    <Name>GratingAzimuthDeg</Name>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="IncludeWorkflow" Path="BonVision:Primitives.DrawGratings.bonsai">
                    <LocationX>0</LocationX>
                    <LocationY>0</LocationY>
                    <Layer>0</Layer>
                    <ExtentX>100</ExtentX>
                    <ExtentY>100</ExtentY>
                    <SpatialFrequency>0.06666667</SpatialFrequency>
                    <TemporalFrequency>0</TemporalFrequency>
                    <Phase>0</Phase>
                    <Angle>0</Angle>
                    <SquareWave>false</SquareWave>
                    <Contrast>0</Contrast>
                    <DutyCycle xsi:nil="true" />
                    <Radius>1</Radius>
                    <Aperture>0.4</Aperture>
                    <Opacity>1</Opacity>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
                    <Name>VisualStimulusOff</Name>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
                    <Combinator xsi:type="rx:TakeUntil" />
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="WorkflowOutput" />
                  <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
                    <Combinator xsi:type="rx:TakeUntil" />
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="IncludeWorkflow" Path="BonVision:Primitives.DrawQuad.bonsai">
                    <ExtentX>30</ExtentX>
                    <ExtentY>30</ExtentY>
                    <LocationX>130</LocationX>
                    <LocationY>-22.5</LocationY>
                    <Layer>0</Layer>
                    <Angle>0</Angle>
                    <ColorR>0</ColorR>
                    <ColorG>0</ColorG>
                    <ColorB>0</ColorB>
                    <ColorA>1</ColorA>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
                    <Combinator xsi:type="rx:TakeUntil" />
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="IncludeWorkflow" Path="BonVision:Primitives.DrawQuad.bonsai">
                    <ExtentX>30</ExtentX>
                    <ExtentY>30</ExtentY>
                    <LocationX>130</LocationX>
                    <LocationY>-22.5</LocationY>
                    <Layer>0</Layer>
                    <Angle>0</Angle>
                    <ColorR>1</ColorR>
                    <ColorG>1</ColorG>
                    <ColorB>1</ColorB>
                    <ColorA>1</ColorA>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
                    <Combinator xsi:type="rx:IgnoreElements" />
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
                    <Name>AuditoryStimulusSet</Name>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="PropertyMapping">
                    <PropertyMappings>
                      <Property Name="Period" Selector="FlickerHalfPeriod" />
                    </PropertyMappings>
                  </Expression>
                </Nodes>
                <Edges>
                  <Edge From="0" To="1" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="1" To="2" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="4" To="5" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="3" To="6" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="5" To="6" Label="Source2" />
                  <Edge From="6" To="7" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="7" To="8" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="6" To="9" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="9" To="10" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="12" To="11" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="14" To="13" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="17" To="15" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="19" To="18" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="8" To="20" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="11" To="20" Label="Source2" />
                  <Edge From="13" To="20" Label="Source3" />
                  <Edge From="15" To="20" Label="Source4" />
                  <Edge From="18" To="20" Label="Source5" />
                  <Edge From="20" To="22" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="21" To="22" Label="Source2" />
                  <Edge From="22" To="23" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="8" To="25" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="25" To="24" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="21" To="24" Label="Source2" />
                  <Edge From="10" To="27" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="27" To="26" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="21" To="26" Label="Source2" />
                  <Edge From="2" To="28" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="29" To="30" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="30" To="4" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="16" To="17" Label="Source1" />
                </Edges>
              </Workflow>
            </Expression>
          </Nodes>
          <Edges>
            <Edge From="0" To="1" Label="Source1" />
          </Edges>
        </Workflow>
      </Expression>
      <Expression xsi:type="GroupWorkflow">
        <Name>Audio</Name>
        <Description>The sounds, played by DomeHardware's speakers and mixer (OpenRigs.Audio SpeakerMixer: Speakers, and the mixer started no sooner than 3 s after Start, never sooner, as a fault while the sound card boots can blue-screen the PC); each trial's sound and the penalty sound at the task file's level in dBFS RMS (levelDbfs), checked when the task file is read at Go; the background noise at the launch's task file's level, checked at Start and sent at Ready.</Description>
        <Workflow>
          <Nodes>
            <Expression xsi:type="GroupWorkflow">
              <Name>LoadAudioFiles</Name>
              <Description>The auditory stimulus set equalised for rig.yml's speakers at Start (LoadAuditoryStimulusSet), then at Go at the task's audioStimulus.levelDbfs (LevelAuditoryStimulusSet, which stops the workflow if any would peak at -1 dBFS after equalisation); the lab's penalty sound on penaltySoundChannel at penalty.sound.levelDbfs. The background noise is the BackgroundNoise include's, after Audio.</Description>
              <Workflow>
                <Nodes>
                  <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
                    <Name>Speakers</Name>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
                    <Combinator xsi:type="p1:LoadAuditoryStimulusSet">
                      <p1:Folder>LocalFiles\AuditoryStimuli</p1:Folder>
                      <p1:FilePrefix>filtered_pink_pulse_train_</p1:FilePrefix>
                    </Combinator>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
                    <Combinator xsi:type="rx:Take">
                      <rx:Count>1</rx:Count>
                    </Combinator>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="rx:AsyncSubject">
                    <Name>AuditoryStimulusSet</Name>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
                    <Name>AuditoryStimulusSet</Name>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
                    <Name>TaskConfig</Name>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="MemberSelector">
                    <Selector>TaskParameters.AudioStimulus.LevelDbfs</Selector>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
                    <Combinator xsi:type="rx:Zip" />
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
                    <Combinator xsi:type="p1:LevelAuditoryStimulusSet" />
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="rx:AsyncSubject">
                    <Name>LevelledStimulusSet</Name>
                  </Expression>
                </Nodes>
                <Edges>
                  <Edge From="0" To="1" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="1" To="2" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="2" To="3" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="4" To="7" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="5" To="6" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="6" To="7" Label="Source2" />
                  <Edge From="7" To="8" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="8" To="9" Label="Source1" />
                </Edges>
              </Workflow>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
              <Name>AuditoryStimulus</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="rx:Condition">
              <Name>AudioEnabled?</Name>
              <Description>Discrimination's visual and neutral trials play no sound.</Description>
              <Workflow>
                <Nodes>
                  <Expression xsi:type="WorkflowInput">
                    <Name>Source1</Name>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="scr:ExpressionTransform">
                    <scr:Expression>audioEnabled</scr:Expression>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="WorkflowOutput" />
                </Nodes>
                <Edges>
                  <Edge From="0" To="1" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="1" To="2" Label="Source1" />
                </Edges>
              </Workflow>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="rx:SelectMany">
              <Name>PlayStim</Name>
              <Description>Plays a trial's sound: its waveform equalised for its speaker (the channel of rig.yml's speaker nearest the drawn location), at the task's audioStimulus.levelDbfs, with the sync copy on rig.yml's syncChannel at syncGain.</Description>
              <Workflow>
                <Nodes>
                  <Expression xsi:type="WorkflowInput">
                    <Name>Source1</Name>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
                    <Combinator xsi:type="rx:Take">
                      <rx:Count>1</rx:Count>
                    </Combinator>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="rx:AsyncSubject">
                    <Name>SoundTrial</Name>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
                    <Combinator xsi:type="rx:Zip" />
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
                    <Name>LevelledStimulusSet</Name>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
                    <Name>SoundTrial</Name>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
                    <Combinator xsi:type="p1:SelectAuditoryStimulus" />
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="MulticastSubject">
                    <Name>StimulusSounds</Name>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
                    <Combinator xsi:type="rx:IgnoreElements" />
                  </Expression>
                </Nodes>
                <Edges>
                  <Edge From="0" To="1" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="1" To="2" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="4" To="3" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="5" To="3" Label="Source2" />
                  <Edge From="3" To="6" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="2" To="8" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="6" To="7" Label="Source1" />
                </Edges>
              </Workflow>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
              <Name>PenaltySound</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="IncludeWorkflow" Path="OpenRigs.Audio:PlayPenaltySound.bonsai" />
          </Nodes>
          <Edges>
            <Edge From="1" To="2" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="2" To="3" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="4" To="5" Label="Source1" />
          </Edges>
        </Workflow>
      </Expression>
      <Expression xsi:type="IncludeWorkflow" Path="OpenRigs.Audio:BackgroundNoise.bonsai">
        <Description>The background noise, the lab's one file, rig.yml's speakerArray.backgroundNoise (60 s of white noise, 32-bit float), unequalised on every speaker at the launched task file's backgroundNoise.levelDbfs from Ready; Go stops if the task file changed backgroundNoise after launch.</Description>
      </Expression>
      <Expression xsi:type="IncludeWorkflow" Path="OpenRigs.Devices:Zapit.ConnectForTask.bonsai" />
      <Expression xsi:type="GroupWorkflow">
        <Name>Logging</Name>
        <Description>Everything else written to the experiment folder (LogLabExperiment, before Hardware, makes it at Go, with BonsaiData_Async, Settings_Rig and Settings_Experiment; each device logs itself): TaskLogs (OpenRigs.Logging) writes Settings_Task (the task file as JSON), BonsaiData_Trial and Zapit's logs; ExperimentRecords, last but LiveView, delivers and logs rewards (a valve with no calibration stops the workflow, for every mouse), adds the controller's events to BonsaiData_Async, records the Harp devices and writes the manifest.</Description>
        <Workflow>
          <Nodes>
            <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
              <Name>TaskConfig</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
              <Combinator xsi:type="p6:SerializeToJson">
                <p6:Formatting>Indented</p6:Formatting>
              </Combinator>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="IncludeWorkflow" Path="OpenRigs.Logging:TaskLogs.bonsai" />
          </Nodes>
          <Edges>
            <Edge From="0" To="1" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="1" To="2" Label="Source1" />
          </Edges>
        </Workflow>
      </Expression>
      <Expression xsi:type="GroupWorkflow">
        <Name>Status</Name>
        <Description>The current trial's facts as metrics, named as BonsaiData_Trial's columns (trialNumber, target, trialType, visualAzimuthDeg, audioAzimuthDeg, rewardSizeUl, laserCondition; the trainingStage is TrainingStage's); rig-control computes counts, water and performance from the files.</Description>
        <Workflow>
          <Nodes>
            <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
              <Name>Trial</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="MemberSelector">
              <Selector>trialNumber</Selector>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
              <Combinator xsi:type="orcl:ReportMetric">
                <orcl:Name>trialNumber</orcl:Name>
              </Combinator>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="MemberSelector">
              <Selector>target</Selector>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
              <Combinator xsi:type="orcl:ReportMetric">
                <orcl:Name>target</orcl:Name>
              </Combinator>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="MemberSelector">
              <Selector>trialType</Selector>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
              <Combinator xsi:type="orcl:ReportMetric">
                <orcl:Name>trialType</orcl:Name>
              </Combinator>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="MemberSelector">
              <Selector>visualAzimuthDeg</Selector>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
              <Combinator xsi:type="orcl:ReportMetric">
                <orcl:Name>visualAzimuthDeg</orcl:Name>
              </Combinator>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="MemberSelector">
              <Selector>audioAzimuthDeg</Selector>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
              <Combinator xsi:type="orcl:ReportMetric">
                <orcl:Name>audioAzimuthDeg</orcl:Name>
              </Combinator>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="MemberSelector">
              <Selector>rewardSizeUl</Selector>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
              <Combinator xsi:type="orcl:ReportMetric">
                <orcl:Name>rewardSizeUl</orcl:Name>
              </Combinator>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="MemberSelector">
              <Selector>laserCondition</Selector>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
              <Combinator xsi:type="orcl:ReportMetric">
                <orcl:Name>laserCondition</orcl:Name>
              </Combinator>
            </Expression>
          </Nodes>
          <Edges>
            <Edge From="0" To="1" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="1" To="2" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="0" To="3" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="3" To="4" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="0" To="5" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="5" To="6" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="0" To="7" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="7" To="8" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="0" To="9" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="9" To="10" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="0" To="11" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="11" To="12" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="0" To="13" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="13" To="14" Label="Source1" />
          </Edges>
        </Workflow>
      </Expression>
      <Expression xsi:type="IncludeWorkflow" Path="OpenRigs.Devices:BehaviorBoard.ManualRewards.bonsai" />
      <Expression xsi:type="GroupWorkflow">
        <Name>TaskLogic</Name>
        <Description>The trial loop, every wait on the Harp clock (Core HarpDelay on Timestamp): the task checked at Go (CheckTaskAtGo); once the experiment folder exists, the spouts out (on a stage with spout movements) and the first trial drawn, its interval starting then. Each trial is drawn at the start of its interval (the last outcome, after any timeout); WaitForTrialStart holds it until the interval's end less the lead (max(laserToStimulusSeconds, 0)) and the stage's quiet waits; the stimulus comes the lead after the trial start (LeadToStimulus) in every experiment; with optogenetics, Laser arms Zapit during the interval and raises the ZapitTrigger line at laserToStimulusSeconds before the stimulus (after it if negative), stopping the workflow if Zapit has not answered by then. Zapit adds no time.</Description>
        <Workflow>
          <Nodes>
            <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
              <Name>PathPrefix</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
              <Combinator xsi:type="rx:Take">
                <rx:Count>1</rx:Count>
              </Combinator>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
              <Name>OnNextTick</Name>
              <Description>The experiment folder stamped with the next Harp clock tick and given from the clock's thread (OnNextTick, tested C#), so the first draw runs as every later one does. WithLatestTimestamp here ran it under a lock the clock needs, and the clock stopped at trial 1 (BLUE-OPTO-2, 14 Nov 2026).</Description>
              <Combinator xsi:type="p1:OnNextTick" />
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
              <Combinator xsi:type="p1:StartTrials" />
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
              <Combinator xsi:type="rx:Merge" />
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
              <Name>TrialEnds</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
              <Name>RigConfigs</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="MemberSelector">
              <Selector>SpeakerArray</Selector>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
              <Combinator xsi:type="rx:CombineLatest" />
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
              <Name>TaskConfig</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="PropertyMapping">
              <PropertyMappings>
                <Property Name="TrainingStage" />
              </PropertyMappings>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
              <Name>TrainingStage</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
              <Name>DrawTrial</Name>
              <Description>Draws each trial (TrialDraw, tested C#) at the start of its interval, from the last trial's end, the task and rig.yml's speakers; the first once the experiment folder exists, its interval starting then.</Description>
              <Combinator xsi:type="p1:DrawTrial">
                <p1:TrainingStage>0</p1:TrainingStage>
              </Combinator>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="MulticastSubject">
              <Name>Trial</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
              <Name>Timestamp</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
              <Name>LickStateLeft</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
              <Name>LickStateRight</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
              <Name>WheelDistanceCm</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
              <Name>WaitForTrialStart</Name>
              <Description>Each trial's start (tested C#), on the Harp clock: the end of its interval less the lead (max(laserToStimulusSeconds, 0)), or later until the stage's quiet waits both hold (both spouts released for lickQuietSeconds, a held contact blocking the start; the wheel within wheelQuietCm, forward and back added, over the last wheelQuietSeconds; each counted from the interval's start). Sets startTime and quietWaitSeconds.</Description>
              <Combinator xsi:type="p1:WaitForTrialStart" />
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="rx:BehaviorSubject">
              <Name>TrialStart</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="IncludeWorkflow" Path="Bonsai.Harp:WithLatestTimestamp.bonsai">
              <Name>Timestamp</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
              <Combinator xsi:type="p1:SecondsUntil">
                <p1:Moment>Stimulus</p1:Moment>
              </Combinator>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="InputMapping">
              <PropertyMappings>
                <Property Name="DueSeconds" Selector="Item2" />
              </PropertyMappings>
              <Selector>Item1</Selector>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
              <Name>Timestamp</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
              <Name>LeadToStimulus</Name>
              <Description>The stimulus the lead (max(laserToStimulusSeconds, 0)) after the trial start, in every experiment, optogenetics on or off, so timing never reveals Zapit.</Description>
              <Combinator xsi:type="core:HarpDelay">
                <core:DueSeconds>0.0</core:DueSeconds>
              </Combinator>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="rx:SelectMany">
              <Name>ExecuteTrial</Name>
              <Description>One trial on the Harp clock: the stimulus (VisualStimulus, AuditoryStimulus, its onset stamped as it is commanded; the grating off after stimulusSeconds), the spouts in after stimulusToSpoutsInSeconds, the response window after openLoopSeconds; at the outcome, the trial's row (TrialRow) and what the outcome sets off (TrialConsequence: the reward, the spouts, the penalty sound); then the timeout; at its end the TrialEnd leaves, stamped with the interval's start, so the next trial is drawn and Zapit armed while the interval runs; drinkSeconds into the interval the spouts go out, and the trial ends.</Description>
              <Workflow>
                <Nodes>
                  <Expression xsi:type="WorkflowInput">
                    <Name>Source1</Name>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="MemberSelector">
                    <Selector>Value</Selector>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
                    <Combinator xsi:type="rx:Take">
                      <rx:Count>1</rx:Count>
                    </Combinator>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="rx:AsyncSubject">
                    <Name>ExecTrial</Name>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
                    <Name>ExecTrial</Name>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="MemberSelector">
                    <Selector>visualAzimuthDeg</Selector>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="MulticastSubject">
                    <Name>GratingAzimuthStart</Name>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="MulticastSubject">
                    <Name>GratingAzimuthDeg</Name>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
                    <Name>ExecTrial</Name>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
                    <Combinator xsi:type="IntProperty">
                      <Value>0</Value>
                    </Combinator>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="MulticastSubject">
                    <Name>DecisionVariable</Name>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
                    <Name>ExecTrial</Name>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="MulticastSubject">
                    <Name>VisualStimulus</Name>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="MulticastSubject">
                    <Name>AuditoryStimulus</Name>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="IncludeWorkflow" Path="Bonsai.Harp:WithLatestTimestamp.bonsai">
                    <Name>Timestamp</Name>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="MemberSelector">
                    <Selector>Seconds</Selector>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="rx:AsyncSubject">
                    <Name>Onset</Name>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
                    <Name>Onset</Name>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
                    <Name>StimulusOff</Name>
                    <Combinator xsi:type="core:HarpDelay">
                      <core:DueSeconds>0.0</core:DueSeconds>
                    </Combinator>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
                    <Name>Timestamp</Name>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
                    <Name>TaskConfig</Name>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="PropertyMapping">
                    <PropertyMappings>
                      <Property Name="DueSeconds" Selector="TaskParameters.TrialStructure.StimulusSeconds" />
                    </PropertyMappings>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="MulticastSubject">
                    <Name>VisualStimulusOffFeed</Name>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
                    <Name>Onset</Name>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
                    <Name>SpoutsIn</Name>
                    <Combinator xsi:type="core:HarpDelay">
                      <core:DueSeconds>0.0</core:DueSeconds>
                    </Combinator>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
                    <Name>Timestamp</Name>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
                    <Name>TaskConfig</Name>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="PropertyMapping">
                    <PropertyMappings>
                      <Property Name="DueSeconds" Selector="TaskParameters.TrialStructure.StimulusToSpoutsInSeconds" />
                    </PropertyMappings>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
                    <Combinator xsi:type="rx:WithLatestFrom" />
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
                    <Name>ExecTrial</Name>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
                    <Combinator xsi:type="p1:SpoutsIn" />
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="MemberSelector">
                    <Selector>Item2</Selector>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="MulticastSubject">
                    <Name>LickSpoutStageFeed</Name>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
                    <Name>Onset</Name>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
                    <Name>OpenLoop</Name>
                    <Combinator xsi:type="core:HarpDelay">
                      <core:DueSeconds>0.0</core:DueSeconds>
                    </Combinator>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
                    <Name>Timestamp</Name>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
                    <Name>TaskConfig</Name>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="PropertyMapping">
                    <PropertyMappings>
                      <Property Name="DueSeconds" Selector="TaskParameters.TrialStructure.OpenLoopSeconds" />
                    </PropertyMappings>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="rx:SelectMany">
                    <Name>Response</Name>
                    <Description>The response window, from the end of the open loop for closedLoopSeconds on the Harp clock: each lick adds 1 (left) or -1 (right) to DecisionVariable, which moves the grating degreesPerLick per lick; the choice is the side whose net licks reach thresholdLicks first, else NoResponse at the window's end.</Description>
                    <Workflow>
                      <Nodes>
                        <Expression xsi:type="rx:PublishSubject" TypeArguments="sys:String">
                          <rx:Name>ResponseDone</rx:Name>
                        </Expression>
                        <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
                          <Name>LickStateLeft</Name>
                        </Expression>
                        <Expression xsi:type="rx:Condition">
                          <Name>Lick?</Name>
                          <Workflow>
                            <Nodes>
                              <Expression xsi:type="WorkflowInput">
                                <Name>Source1</Name>
                              </Expression>
                              <Expression xsi:type="scr:ExpressionTransform">
                                <scr:Expression>it</scr:Expression>
                              </Expression>
                              <Expression xsi:type="WorkflowOutput" />
                            </Nodes>
                            <Edges>
                              <Edge From="0" To="1" Label="Source1" />
                              <Edge From="1" To="2" Label="Source1" />
                            </Edges>
                          </Workflow>
                        </Expression>
                        <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
                          <Combinator xsi:type="IntProperty">
                            <Value>1</Value>
                          </Combinator>
                        </Expression>
                        <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
                          <Name>LickStateRight</Name>
                        </Expression>
                        <Expression xsi:type="rx:Condition">
                          <Name>Lick?</Name>
                          <Workflow>
                            <Nodes>
                              <Expression xsi:type="WorkflowInput">
                                <Name>Source1</Name>
                              </Expression>
                              <Expression xsi:type="scr:ExpressionTransform">
                                <scr:Expression>it</scr:Expression>
                              </Expression>
                              <Expression xsi:type="WorkflowOutput" />
                            </Nodes>
                            <Edges>
                              <Edge From="0" To="1" Label="Source1" />
                              <Edge From="1" To="2" Label="Source1" />
                            </Edges>
                          </Workflow>
                        </Expression>
                        <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
                          <Combinator xsi:type="IntProperty">
                            <Value>-1</Value>
                          </Combinator>
                        </Expression>
                        <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
                          <Combinator xsi:type="rx:Merge" />
                        </Expression>
                        <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
                          <Combinator xsi:type="rx:TakeUntil" />
                        </Expression>
                        <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
                          <Name>ResponseDone</Name>
                        </Expression>
                        <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
                          <Combinator xsi:type="rx:WithLatestFrom" />
                        </Expression>
                        <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
                          <Name>DecisionVariable</Name>
                        </Expression>
                        <Expression xsi:type="Add" />
                        <Expression xsi:type="MulticastSubject">
                          <Name>DecisionVariable</Name>
                        </Expression>
                        <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
                          <Combinator xsi:type="rx:WithLatestFrom" />
                        </Expression>
                        <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
                          <Name>TaskConfig</Name>
                        </Expression>
                        <Expression xsi:type="MemberSelector">
                          <Selector>TaskParameters.Response.DegreesPerLick</Selector>
                        </Expression>
                        <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
                          <Combinator xsi:type="rx:WithLatestFrom" />
                        </Expression>
                        <Expression xsi:type="Multiply" />
                        <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
                          <Name>GratingAzimuthStart</Name>
                        </Expression>
                        <Expression xsi:type="Add" />
                        <Expression xsi:type="MulticastSubject">
                          <Name>GratingAzimuthDeg</Name>
                        </Expression>
                        <Expression xsi:type="WorkflowInput">
                          <Name>Source1</Name>
                        </Expression>
                        <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
                          <Name>ResponseWindow</Name>
                          <Combinator xsi:type="core:HarpDelay">
                            <core:DueSeconds>0.0</core:DueSeconds>
                          </Combinator>
                        </Expression>
                        <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
                          <Name>Timestamp</Name>
                        </Expression>
                        <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
                          <Name>TaskConfig</Name>
                        </Expression>
                        <Expression xsi:type="PropertyMapping">
                          <PropertyMappings>
                            <Property Name="DueSeconds" Selector="TaskParameters.TrialStructure.ClosedLoopSeconds" />
                          </PropertyMappings>
                        </Expression>
                        <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
                          <Combinator xsi:type="rx:Take">
                            <rx:Count>1</rx:Count>
                          </Combinator>
                        </Expression>
                        <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
                          <Combinator xsi:type="StringProperty">
                            <Value>NoResponse</Value>
                          </Combinator>
                        </Expression>
                        <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
                          <Combinator xsi:type="rx:WithLatestFrom" />
                        </Expression>
                        <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
                          <Name>TaskConfig</Name>
                        </Expression>
                        <Expression xsi:type="MemberSelector">
                          <Selector>TaskParameters.Response.ThresholdLicks</Selector>
                        </Expression>
                        <Expression xsi:type="scr:ExpressionCondition">
                          <scr:Expression>Item1 &gt;= Item2</scr:Expression>
                        </Expression>
                        <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
                          <Combinator xsi:type="rx:Take">
                            <rx:Count>1</rx:Count>
                          </Combinator>
                        </Expression>
                        <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
                          <Combinator xsi:type="StringProperty">
                            <Value>Left</Value>
                          </Combinator>
                        </Expression>
                        <Expression xsi:type="scr:ExpressionCondition">
                          <scr:Expression>Item1 &lt;= -Item2</scr:Expression>
                        </Expression>
                        <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
                          <Combinator xsi:type="rx:Take">
                            <rx:Count>1</rx:Count>
                          </Combinator>
                        </Expression>
                        <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
                          <Combinator xsi:type="StringProperty">
                            <Value>Right</Value>
                          </Combinator>
                        </Expression>
                        <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
                          <Combinator xsi:type="rx:Merge" />
                        </Expression>
                        <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
                          <Combinator xsi:type="rx:Take">
                            <rx:Count>1</rx:Count>
                          </Combinator>
                        </Expression>
                        <Expression xsi:type="MulticastSubject">
                          <Name>ResponseDone</Name>
                        </Expression>
                        <Expression xsi:type="WorkflowOutput" />
                      </Nodes>
                      <Edges>
                        <Edge From="1" To="2" Label="Source1" />
                        <Edge From="2" To="3" Label="Source1" />
                        <Edge From="4" To="5" Label="Source1" />
                        <Edge From="5" To="6" Label="Source1" />
                        <Edge From="3" To="7" Label="Source1" />
                        <Edge From="6" To="7" Label="Source2" />
                        <Edge From="7" To="8" Label="Source1" />
                        <Edge From="9" To="8" Label="Source2" />
                        <Edge From="8" To="10" Label="Source1" />
                        <Edge From="11" To="10" Label="Source2" />
                        <Edge From="10" To="12" Label="Source1" />
                        <Edge From="12" To="13" Label="Source1" />
                        <Edge From="15" To="16" Label="Source1" />
                        <Edge From="13" To="14" Label="Source1" />
                        <Edge From="16" To="14" Label="Source2" />
